      "text": {
        "jp": "感情を見極めろって……。\r\n魔物の感情なんてわかるかな。",
        "official_en": "Discern emotions? How can we tell what a monster is feeling? It’s not like we can ask it.",
        "real_en": "'Watch its emotions'? How are we supposed to tell how a monster feels?"
      },
