      "text": {
        "jp": "石碑には\r\n「怒りと鎮静は交互に訪れる。感情を見極めよ」\r\nって書いてあるな。",
        "official_en": "“Serene in one turn, but in another its fury does burn. Its mercurial emotion you shall discern.”",
        "real_en": "It says, 'Anger and calm alternate. Watch its emotions carefully.'"
